	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tuas accepi literas scriptas 4. huius mensis, fuitque iucundissimum videre <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>te confirmatum et sanum esse atque mea recepisse literas.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> scribunt <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>d<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ie Iovis ultima civem unum, cum in pompa ferretur <placeName ref="l301">Lugduni</placeName> sacramentum, abiecisse in terram <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>et dixisse sacerdoti: "Tu impie exhibes ex massa adorandum factitium deum", tumque a vulgo <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>concitato a sacerdotibus fuere aliqui interfecti.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Suspicor idem accidisse aliis in locis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Ex <placeName ref="l875">Hispania</placeName> 21. maii scribitur urbem <placeName>Cieuta</placeName>, que pertinet ad regem <placeName>Luzitanie</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>in <placeName>Barbaria</placeName>, obsessam esse a Moris; est ibi portus elegans.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><persName>Ducem Brunsvicensem</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>profectum ab aula <persName>Philippi</persName>, ne eo absente sua quis invaderet, atque ita fuisse <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>tractatum in <placeName ref="l875">Hispania</placeName>, ut contentus non sit.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Seville infinitos captos <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>religionis ergo nec carceres sufficere et plures esse in omnibus locis maritimis.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>20. maii <placeName ref="l1719">Toledo</placeName> discessit <persName>Philippus</persName>, petit <persName>Arenchoys</persName> et <persName>Madry</persName>; creditores omnes male <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>tractat offerens illis loco sexdecim solum quinque et incertissima.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Opus <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>erit me offerre et obsignare decem pro centum, nec deerunt, qui <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>conquerantur et sibi fieri iniuriam putent, quod de preda aliquid decedat.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Maior pars pecunie, quę Helvetiis promissa a me est, hoc mense hic pręsens <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>erit, poteroque Gręca fide agere cum oculatis manibus.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis amicos <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Filius agit gratias de Germanico libello.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l760">Solud[uri]</placeName> 11. iunii.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Tuus ex animo <persName ref="p629">Coignetius</persName></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[von anderer Hand:]</note>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>An herren <persName ref="p495">Heinrichen <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullinger</persName> <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
